    "text": "When Shanghai-style qipao steps out of historical images, can it become daily wear for contemporary people? To find the answer, China Daily reporter spoke with Professor Liu Yu from Donghua University, author of The History of Chinese Qipao Culture , and tried on Shanghai-style qipao with a sense of contemporary style. Click the video and discover the beauty of Shanghai-style qipao .",
